※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4004 LANG_VARDEF_NOT_MUTABLE

※ Nor is a field of one: a singleton is in the image, and everything holding a
※ reference to it reads the same thing for as long as the program runs.

let std := ⎕import("std")

type Limits = low : u8 ; singleton usual : Limits = Limits(.low ← 1u8)

@[startup, impure]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    Limits.usual.low ← 2u8
    0u6
